## Docs standards

Docs must be:

- **accurate** for current behavior
- **actionable** (commands, paths, examples)
- kept **close to reality** (no aspirational text without status)

When updating docs:
- prefer minimal changes but keep them complete
- include migration notes when config/API behavior changes
- avoid duplicating the same truth in 3 files; use links where possible

